---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="MarynaTrade - International Trade, Import/Export & Global Commerce Guide"
  description="Your comprehensive guide to international trade, import/export procedures, supply chain management, trade finance, global logistics, and customs regulations."
  lang="en"
>
  <Fragment slot="logo">MarynaTrade</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="footer-name">MarynaTrade</Fragment>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>International Trade & Global Commerce Hub</h1>
    <p>Your trusted resource for import/export guidance, supply chain strategies, trade finance solutions, and navigating customs & tariffs worldwide.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="ad-slot">Ad Space - Google AdSense</div>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Import/Export Guide</h2>
      <p>Step-by-step procedures for importing and exporting goods across borders. Learn about trade documentation, Incoterms, letters of credit, and compliance requirements for successful international transactions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Supply Chain Management</h2>
      <p>Optimize your global supply chain with proven strategies for sourcing, procurement, inventory management, and vendor relations. Reduce costs and improve delivery times across international markets.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Trade Finance Solutions</h2>
      <p>Explore trade finance instruments including letters of credit, bank guarantees, export credit insurance, and factoring. Secure funding and mitigate risks in cross-border transactions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Global Logistics</h2>
      <p>Navigate international freight forwarding, shipping routes, warehousing, and last-mile delivery. Compare ocean, air, rail, and multimodal transport options for cost-effective global distribution.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Customs & Tariffs</h2>
      <p>Stay current on customs regulations, tariff schedules, HS codes, duty calculations, and free trade agreements. Ensure compliance and minimize duties through proper classification and origin rules.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Market Entry Strategies</h2>
      <p>Research and plan your expansion into new international markets. Analyze trade barriers, regulatory environments, cultural considerations, and partnership opportunities for successful global growth.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-slot">Ad Space - Google AdSense</div>
</BaseLayout>
